## Session-start ritual

> If this repo uses Lintel, Claude Code auto-loads a digest (active pack/mode/role + recent lessons +
> open jobs + recent decisions) via the `session-digest` SessionStart hook. This ritual is the deeper
> read on top of that — **and the fallback for non-hook CLIs** (Codex, Gemini, …), which read these
> files explicitly.

1. Read this file + `CORE-PRINCIPLES.md`.
2. Review recent `tasks/lessons.md` — accumulated lessons. **Read before acting.**
3. Skim `tasks/memory.md` (durable state) + `tasks/personas.md` (operator calibration).
4. List `docs/adr/` — read any decision record relevant to the task.

