## Shared Schema Discipline

When two or more components communicate (event buses, APIs, databases, IPC):

1. Define the schema ONCE in a shared location
2. Both sides import from shared. Never duplicate the definition locally.
3. Never reinterpret the schema differently in two components.
4. Write at least one integration test per communication link.

